    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Il y a 70 ans, les ordonnances promulguant les champs d\u2019application de la S\u00e9curit\u00e9 sociale \u00e9taient vot\u00e9es par le Gouvernement provisoire de la R\u00e9publique. Un vieux r\u00eave s\u00e9culaire \u00e9manant des peuples - vouloir vivre sans l\u2019angoisse du lendemain - voyait enfin le jour. Le principal b\u00e2tisseur de cet \u00e9difice des plus humanistes qui soit se nommait Ambroise Croizat. Qui le conna\u00eet aujourd\u2019hui ?",
        "english": "Seventy years ago, the edicts promulgating the French social security were voted by the provisonary government of the Republic. A long-held secular dream emanating from the population - to be able to live without anxiety about the future - at last saw the light of day. Ambroise Croizat was the main builder of this most humanist of edifices. Who knows him today?"
    },
